<title>BELGIUM: EUROPE 1ST QTR ALUMINIUM OUTPUT LITTLE CHANGED - EAA.</title>
<headline>EUROPE 1ST QTR ALUMINIUM OUTPUT LITTLE CHANGED - EAA.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>European production of primary aluminium totalled 809,619 tonnes in the first quarter of 1997, up 0.1 percent compared with the year-ago period, the European Aluminium Association said on Monday.</p>
<p>In the fourth quarter of 1996, production totalled 821,153 tonne, up 0.8 percent from the same period the previous year.</p>
<p>Overall output in 1996 rose 2.1 percent to 3.25 million tonnes.</p>
<p>The figures cover production in France, Germany, Greece, Iceland, Italy, Netherlands, Norway, Spain, Sweden, Switzerland, Turkey and Britain.</p>
<p>--Brussels newsroom +322 287 6830</p>
